# SABOTAGE: D2 (ADR-046 §4.6) — the org-less-TARGET arm of Samen.Policy.SameOrgFk is
# reverted to its pre-fix bug: it returns {:error, :target_has_no_org_id}, which
# validate_relationship/3 routes into add_error — REFUSING a write whose belongs_to
# targets a row with no org_id (an org-less anchor / shared cross-org Credential).
# The fix made that arm PASS (an org-less target cannot cross orgs), matching the
# module's own comment and the verifier moduledoc. Reverting it flips the org-less
# PASS proof: the create is refused (changeset invalid) instead of passing. The
# genuine cross-org guard is untouched (its arm still refuses), so this sabotage
# targets ONLY the org-less relaxation — no invariant is weakened by it.
# APP: samen_core
# TEST_FILES: test/same_org_fk_change_test.exs
# MUST_FAIL: a write whose FK targets an org-less row is NOT refused
diff --git a/samen_core/lib/samen/policy/same_org_fk.ex b/samen_core/lib/samen/policy/same_org_fk.ex
index 3262da0..2a316ef 100644
--- a/samen_core/lib/samen/policy/same_org_fk.ex
+++ b/samen_core/lib/samen/policy/same_org_fk.ex
@@ -187,7 +187,7 @@ defmodule Samen.Policy.SameOrgFk do
         # `:org_less_target` sentinel is routed to a pass arm in
         # `validate_relationship/3` (D2 / ADR-046 §4.6) — matching this module's
         # documented contract and the verifier moduledoc, not an add_error refusal.
-        :org_less_target
+        {:error, :target_has_no_org_id}
 
       true ->
         sql =
